#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:-1
msgid "Importing video frames."
msgstr "Import snímok videa."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:9
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "Animácia"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:9
msgid "import"
msgstr "importovať"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:9
msgid "frames"
msgstr "snímky"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:9
msgid "video import"
msgstr "import videa"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:14
msgid "Import Animation"
msgstr "Importovať animáciu"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:16
msgid "Krita has several options for allowing you to import an animation."
msgstr "Krita má niekoľko možností na import animácie."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:21
msgid "Import Frames"
msgstr "Importovať snímky"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:23
msgid ""
"Frame import will import a list of images into an animation layer. This is a "
"format that most other animation software can export, and thus very useful "
"for interchange."
msgstr ""
"Import snímok importuje zoznam obrázkov do animačnej vrstvy. Ide o formát, "
"ktorý dokáže exportovať väčšina iného animačného softvéru, a preto je veľmi "
"užitočný na výmenu."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:25
msgid ""
"First let us take a sprite sheet from Open Game Art. (This is the Libre "
"Pixel Cup male walkcycle [1]_)."
msgstr ""
"Najprv si vezmeme sprite sheet z Open Game Art. (Ide o Libre Pixel Cup "
"mužský cyklus chôdze [1]_)."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:27
msgid "We'll use :ref:`image_split` to split up the sprite sheet."
msgstr "Použijeme :ref:`image_split` na rozdelenie sprite sheetu."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:30
msgid ".. image:: /images/animation/Animation_split_spritesheet.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/animation/Animation_split_spritesheet.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:31
msgid ""
"The slices are even, so for a sprite sheet of 9 sprites, use 8 vertical "
"slices and 0 horizontal slices. Give it a proper name and save it as png."
msgstr ""
"Rezy sú rovnomerné, takže pre sprite sheet s 9 sprites použite 8 "
"vertikálnych rezov a 0 horizontálnych rezov. Dajte mu vhodný názov a uložte "
"ako png."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:33
msgid ""
"Then, make a new canvas, and select :menuselection:`File --> Import "
"Animation Frames`. This will give you a little window. Select :guilabel:`Add "
"images`. This should get you a file browser where you can select your images."
msgstr ""
"Potom vytvorte nové plátno a vyberte :menuselection:`File --> Import "
"Animation Frames`. Zobrazí sa malé okno. Vyberte :guilabel:`Add images`. Tým "
"by ste mali získať prehliadač súborov, kde môžete vybrať svoje obrázky."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:36
msgid ".. image:: /images/animation/Animation_import_sprites.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/animation/Animation_import_sprites.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:37
msgid "You can select multiple images at once."
msgstr "Môžete vybrať viac obrázkov naraz."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:40
msgid ".. image:: /images/animation/Animation_set_everything.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/animation/Animation_set_everything.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:41
msgid ""
"The frames are currently automatically ordered. You can set the ordering "
"with the top-left two drop-down boxes."
msgstr ""
"Snímky sú momentálne automaticky zoradené. Poradie môžete nastaviť pomocou "
"dvoch rozbaľovacích polí vľavo hore."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:44
msgid ""
"Press :guilabel:`OK`, and your animation should be imported as a new layer."
msgstr ""
"Stlačte :guilabel:`OK` a vaša animácia by mala byť importovaná ako nová "
"vrstva."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:47
msgid ".. image:: /images/animation/Animation_import_done.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/animation/Animation_import_done.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:48
msgid "Add images."
msgstr "Pridať obrázky."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:49
msgid "Add frames. You can select multiple frames in the file chooser."
msgstr "Pridať snímky. Môžete vybrať viac snímok vo výbere súborov."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:50
msgid "Remove."
msgstr "Odstrániť."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:51
msgid "Remove the selected frame"
msgstr "Odstrániť vybranú snímku"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:53
msgid "Add hold frames automatically."
msgstr "Pridať výdrž snímok automaticky."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:53
msgid ""
"If a frame sequence has gaps, such as a sequence that has frames 1, 2 and 5, "
"ticking this option will input empty frames at 3 and 4."
msgstr ""
"Ak má sekvencia snímok medzery, napríklad sekvencia so snímkami 1, 2 a 5, "
"zaškrtnutie tejto možnosti vloží prázdne snímky na pozície 3 a 4."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:56
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Poradie"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:58
msgid "Ascending vs Descending"
msgstr "Vzostupne vs zostupne"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:59
msgid ""
"Whether it will import the frames in order from lowest to highest "
"(ascending), or from highest to lowest (descending)."
msgstr ""
"Či sa snímky importujú od najnižšej po najvyššiu (vzostupne) alebo od "
"najvyššej po najnižšiu (zostupne)."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:61
msgid "Numerical vs Alphabetical"
msgstr "Číselné vs abecedné"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:61
msgid "Whether it will use numbers or Alphabetical ordering for the frames."
msgstr "Či sa pre snímky použije číselné alebo abecedné poradie."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:64
msgid "Timing"
msgstr "Časovanie"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:66
#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:122
msgid "Start at"
msgstr "Začať na"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:67
msgid ""
"The frame number to import at. Importing at 3 will have the resulting "
"animation start at frame 3 within Krita."
msgstr ""
"Číslo snímky, od ktorého sa má importovať. Importovanie od snímky 3 spôsobí, "
"že výsledná animácia bude v Krite začínať od snímky 3."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:68
msgid "Step"
msgstr "Step"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:69
msgid ""
"The amount of frames to input for each imported frame. For importing a 6 fps "
"animation into a 24 fps animation, you will need to set this to 24 / 6 = 4. "
"This will ensure the playback speed stays the same."
msgstr ""
"Počet snímok, ktoré sa vložia pre každú importovanú snímku. Pri importe "
"animácie s 6 fps do animácie s 24 fps bude potrebné nastaviť túto hodnotu na "
"24 / 6 = 4. Tým sa zabezpečí, že rýchlosť prehrávania zostane rovnaká."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:71
msgid "Source FPS"
msgstr "FPS zdroja:"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:71
msgid ""
"This displays what Krita thinks the fps of the input is with the current "
"timing settings. You can use this to make sure that the input you made is "
"correct with the FPS of your document."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazuje, akú snímkovú frekvenciu vstupu Krita odhaduje pri aktuálnych "
"nastaveniach časovania. Môžete to použiť na overenie, či zadaný vstup "
"zodpovedá FPS vášho dokumentu."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:76
msgid "Import video file"
msgstr "Importovať video súbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:78
msgid ""
"Video import allows you to import a sample of a video file as an animated "
"paint layer."
msgstr ""
"Import videa umožňuje importovať úsek video súboru ako animovanú maľovaciu "
"vrstvu."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:82
msgid ""
"On Android, importing video files is unavailable. You have to use a computer "
"to import the video, save it to a KRA file and transfer it to your device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:85
msgid ".. image:: /images/animation/import_video.png"
msgstr ".. image:: /images/animation/import_video.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:86
msgid "Choose a video file"
msgstr "Vybrať video súbor"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:87
msgid ""
"This will bring up a file chooser for you to select the file in question."
msgstr "Otvorí sa výber súborov, kde môžete vybrať požadovaný súbor."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:88
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Náhľad"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:89
msgid "Gives a preview of the file to import."
msgstr "Zobrazuje náhľad súboru, ktorý sa má importovať."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:90
msgid "Slider"
msgstr "Posuvník"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:91
msgid "Allows you to scrub through the file in question."
msgstr "Umožňuje pohybovať sa po súbore."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:92
msgid "Frame Counter"
msgstr "Počítadlo snímok"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:93
msgid "Allows you to select the frame in question"
msgstr "Umožňuje vybrať požadovanú snímku"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:95
msgid "Frame Switcher"
msgstr "Prepínač snímok"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:95
msgid "Two buttons to switch per frame."
msgstr "Dve tlačidlá na prepínanie po snímkach."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:98
msgid "Video file info"
msgstr "Informácie o video súbore"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:99
#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:138
#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:146
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Šírka"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:100
msgid "The width of the current file."
msgstr "Šírka aktuálneho súboru."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:101
#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:141
#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:148
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Výška"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:102
msgid "The height of the current file."
msgstr "Výška aktuálneho súboru."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:103
#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:124
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "Trvanie"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:104
msgid "The duration in seconds."
msgstr "Trvanie v sekundách."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:105
msgid "Frames"
msgstr "Rámce"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:106
msgid "The total amount of frames"
msgstr "Celkový počet snímok"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:107
#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:118
msgid "FPS"
msgstr "fps"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:108
msgid "The frames per second."
msgstr "Počet snímok za sekundu."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:109
msgid "Color Primaries"
msgstr "Farebné primárne zložky"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:110
msgid ""
"The name of the color space primaries Krita has detected. These will be used "
"for the color profile with which the file imports. Only shows up on files "
"where this data is detected."
msgstr ""
"Názov primárnych zložiek farebného priestoru, ktoré Krita zistila. Budú sa "
"používať pre farebný profil, s ktorým sa súbor importuje. Zobrazuje sa len "
"pri súboroch, kde boli tieto údaje zistené."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:112
msgid ""
"The name of the color space trc that Krita has found. This too will be used "
"for the color profile. Only shows up on files where this data is detected."
msgstr ""
"Názov krivky prenosu tónov (trc) farebného priestoru, ktorú Krita našla. "
"Táto sa taktiež použije pre farebný profil. Zobrazuje sa len pri súboroch, "
"kde boli tieto údaje zistené."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:113
msgid "Color Transfer"
msgstr "Prenos farby"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:116
msgid "Import Options"
msgstr "Možnosti importu"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:119
msgid ""
"The FPS to import at. Importing 2 seconds of footage at 24 fps will import "
"48 frames, and at 60 fps, 120 frames will be imported."
msgstr ""
"FPS, pri ktorom sa má importovať. Import 2 sekúnd záznamu pri 24 fps "
"importuje 48 snímok, pri 60 fps sa importuje 120 snímok."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:120
msgid "Skip Interval"
msgstr "Interval preskočenia"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:121
msgid ""
"Same as :guilabel:`Step` in the :ref:`Import Frames<import_frames>` section."
msgstr ""
"Rovnaké ako :guilabel:`Step` v sekcii :ref:`Import Frames<import_frames>`."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:123
msgid "Time code to start at."
msgstr "Časový kód, od ktorého sa má začať."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:125
msgid "Length of the imported animation."
msgstr "Dĺžka importovanej animácie."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:127
msgid "Import into"
msgstr "Importovať do"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:127
msgid ""
"Document to import the file into. Options are current document and new "
"document. With new document, extra options become available on the second "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"Dokument, do ktorého sa má súbor importovať. Možnosti sú aktuálny dokument a "
"nový dokument. Pri novom dokumente sa na druhej karte sprístupnia ďalšie "
"možnosti."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:129
msgid ""
"Videos, because you usually only play them in a media player, are compressed "
"in special ways. Because Krita is designed to allow you to draw each "
"individual frame, this data gets uncompressed. What this means is that even "
"though you can watch a video file on your computer, you likely cannot import "
"all the frames into Krita. A warning will be displayed and inform you how "
"many frames you can import with your current setup."
msgstr ""
"Videá sú, pretože ich zvyčajne prehráva len mediálny prehrávač, "
"skomprimované špeciálnymi spôsobmi. Pretože Krita je navrhnutá tak, aby vám "
"umožnila nakresliť každú jednotlivú snímku, tieto údaje sa rozbaľujú. To "
"znamená, že aj keď môžete sledovať video súbor na počítači, pravdepodobne "
"nemôžete importovať všetky snímky do Krity. Zobrazí sa upozornenie "
"informujúce o tom, koľko snímok môžete importovať pri aktuálnom nastavení."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:132
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Možnosti"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:135
msgid "Document Options"
msgstr "Voľby dokumentu"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:136
msgid "Only enabled when the import is into a new document."
msgstr "Povolené len pri importe do nového dokumentu."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:139
msgid "Width of the new document."
msgstr "Šírka nového dokumentu."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:141
msgid "Height of the new document."
msgstr "Výška nového dokumentu."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:144
msgid "Import Video Scale"
msgstr "Importovať video mierku"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:147
msgid "The desired width in pixels"
msgstr "Požadovaná šírka v pixeloch"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:149
msgid "The desired height in pixels"
msgstr "Požadovaná výška v pixeloch"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:151
msgid "The filter to use for the resizing."
msgstr "Filter, ktorý sa má použiť pri zmene veľkosti."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:152
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Filter"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:155
msgid "FFMpeg"
msgstr "FFMpeg"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:157
msgid "FFMpeg Path"
msgstr "Cesta k FFMpeg"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:158
msgid "Path to the ffmpeg executable, necessary for importing the video data."
msgstr "Cesta k spustiteľnému súboru ffmpeg, potrebná na import video údajov."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:160
msgid "FFProbe path"
msgstr "Cesta k FFProbe"

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:160
msgid ""
"Path to the ffmpeg probe executable, which is included with ffmpeg. This "
"allows Krita to learn the video information from the file."
msgstr ""
"Cesta k spustiteľnému súboru ffprobe, ktorý je súčasťou ffmpeg. Umožňuje "
"Krite získať informácie o videu zo súboru."

#: ../../reference_manual/import_animation.rst:164
msgid ""
"`The source for the libre pixel cup male walk cycle <https://opengameart.org/"
"content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Zdroj pre Libre Pixel Cup mužský cyklus chôdze <https://opengameart.org/"
"content/liberated-pixel-cup-lpc-base-assets-sprites-map-tiles>`_"

